      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "100% agree. Because moderation is heavily lacking, i would love to make and maintain a blacklist script to implement in my worlds as well but its against ToS to do so. Not sure if the group id ban falls under a similar branch of reasoning though.\n\nThe problem with the way we, as a community, have to self-moderate is that we have to be reactive rather than proactive. We should be allowed to ban users by ID from groups and worlds altogether.",
